Error [jet.UnbuiltCase]: Case `Light.Off` is never built.
  --> Tests/UI/member_liveness_case_built_match_only.jet:7:5
    |
  7 |     Off,
    |     ^^^
 Why: Code may match this case, but nothing creates it, so the arms that handle it never run. Decoding and foreign code count as building it; matching does not.
 Fix: Remove the case, or rename `Off` to `_Off` when it is intentional.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0107
